{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Shall I go</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other האלך, and והכיתי בפלשתים concerning David, and the other האלך רמות גלעד — to teach that the words of the prophets are fulfilled like the words of Urim and Thummim, for Miriam prophesied about Moses before he was born, as the Sages said:" "<b>(</b> (3) נצים. Three times: here, and the other concerning Sennacherib, להשאות גלים נצים עדים בצורת — one in Kings and one in Isaiah — to teach that the wicked will bear desolation and be utterly destroyed, as it is written: כי מתו כל האנשים המבקשים את נפשך, and as the Sages said: these are Dathan and Abiram who descended from their wealth and their houses were destroyed."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:44.401287154Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}